	(text "requires battery management\nbattery space\nPico/MCU holder\n\nUSB VBUS\n   │\n   ▼\n[USB Power Switch / Inrush Limiter] e.g. TPS2530\n   │\n   ▼\n[MCP73871 Power-Path Charger]\n   │                │\n   │                └── LiPo (1S)\n   ▼\nVSYS (~3.5-4.4 V, low impedance)\n   │\n   ▼\n[Boost Converter → 5 V] TPS61090, TPS61022, TPS61088\n   │\n   ├── Pulsed Load (800 mA)\n   │\n   └── LDO → RC → 3V3 (quiet rail)\n\n5V_OUT ──┬── 47-100 µF polymer (low ESR)\n         ├── 22 µF ceramic\n         └── 100 nF\nLoad node ── 47-100 µF\n\nUSB current behaviour limited by USB switch (hard limit) & MCP73871 (dynamic regulation)\nDuring pulse USB stays at ~500 mA, Battery supplies the extra ~300-600 mA\n\nor MP2636 like DFRobot DFR0446"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
